  "body": "Nestled at the end of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, this premier community boasts breathtaking panoramic coastal views. Hobbs Bay Estate offers a unique Auckland-based lifestyle with direct beach access and generous green spaces, making it a truly exceptional opportunity. At Hobbs Bay Estate, the vision is to create a premier coastal development on the Hibiscus Coast, seamlessly integrating natural beauty with luxury living. The carefully designed development and world-class amenities offer residents an exceptional quality of life, an inclusive community with the serene sea, neighbourly warmth, and the promise of a tranquil, fulfilling future.\r\n\r\n**Signature Homes' stunning Showhome is set for completion by the end of November and presents an exceptional investment opportunity, offering a 4% rental return with a minimum 1-year Showhome lease. Enjoy the benefits of a secure leaseback arrangement before moving into your beautiful new home after just 12 months. Contact the Signature Homes team today to secure this exciting opportunity!**\r\n\r\nThe Showhome is positioned on a corner section with elevated ocean views, blending architectural elegance with modern comfort. Its striking exterior features a Resene Integra concrete façade, JSC timber cladding, and custom aluminium window shrouds. The master suite offers an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and corner windows capturing stunning views. Three double bedrooms upstairs and a separate ground-floor bedroom provide flexible living & are ideal for guests. A raking ceiling enhances the kitchen, living, dining, and alfresco areas, complemented by a custom-designed kitchen, scullery, and laundry. Fully tiled bathrooms, premium tapware, and LED mirrors add luxury, while heat pumps and ducted heating ensure year-round comfort.\r\n\r\n**Key Features:**\r\n- Prime corner section with elevated ocean views\r\n- Resene Integra concrete façade with JSC timber cladding & custom aluminium window shrouds\r\n- Master suite with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and large corner windows\r\n- Three double bedrooms on the top floor plus a separate fourth bedroom on the ground level\r\n- Raking ceiling over the kitchen, living, dining, and alfresco areas\r\n- Bespoke-designed kitchen, scullery, and laundry \r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms featuring premium tapware and LED mirrors\r\n- Year-round comfort with downstairs heat pumps and ducted heating upstairs\r\n- Double-car garage & plenty of space for driveway parking",
